('127.96.d.10.G',3,'To correct nail pops, a finisher should:','["Ignore them", "Paint over them", "Hammer harder only", "Re-fasten the board and recoat the spot"]'::jsonb,3,'Re-securing fixes the cause.','original'),
('127.96.d.10.G',4,'Sanding scratches visible after painting are caused by:','["Using too coarse sandpaper or sanding too hard", "Dust masks", "Primer", "Fine sanding"]'::jsonb,0,'Match sandpaper to the job.','original'),
