('127.96.d.12.D',4,'On a ceiling plan, a light fixture symbol shows:','["Where lights are to be placed", "The wall color", "The paint code", "The door swing"]'::jsonb,0,'Fixtures are located by symbol.','original'),
('127.96.d.12.E',3,'When sketching a ceiling layout, a worker plans the border tiles so they are:','["Missing", "Balanced and not too small", "Mismatched", "Tiny slivers"]'::jsonb,1,'Balanced borders look better.','original'),
('127.96.d.12.E',4,'Finding the center of a room helps the layout because it:','["Adds wires", "Moves lights", "Ensures symmetrical border tiles", "Raises the ceiling"]'::jsonb,2,'Start at the center to balance edges.','original'),
('127.96.d.12.F',3,'To install ceiling tiles, place them:','["Before hangers", "On the floor", "Behind the studs", "In the grid openings after the grid is complete"]'::jsonb,3,'Tiles drop into the grid.','original'),
('127.96.d.12.F',4,'Wear gloves and avoid dropping tiles because tiles can:','["Stain, tear, or crumble", "Shine", "Float", "Bounce"]'::jsonb,0,'Handle carefully to keep tiles clean.','original'),
